{"id":"wb-3-159","name":"苏公塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"苏公塔","text":"苏公塔（维吾尔老文字：سۇلايمان ۋاڭ مۇنارى，拉丁维吾尔文：Sulayman Wang Munari），又称额敏塔（维吾尔老文字：ئىمىن ۋاڭ مۇنارى，拉丁维吾尔文：Imin Wang Munari）、额敏和卓报恩塔，是吐鲁番回部札萨克多罗郡王额敏和卓为“报答天恩”而建的纪念建筑，由清真寺、宣礼塔、麻札等组成。苏公塔修建于清乾隆四十二年（1777年）前后，位于中华人民共和国新疆维吾尔自治区吐鲁番市高昌区。苏公塔是现存新疆境内最大的古塔建筑，同时也是中华人民共和国第三批全国重点文物保护单位。另外，额敏和卓造寺石碑被列入《第一批古代名碑名刻文物》。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%8B%8F%E5%85%AC%E5%A1%94","revisionId":95139214,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=95139214","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/9d7218d821e102c2b8747c18.jpg","title":"苏公塔全景_2023.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E8%8B%8F%E5%85%AC%E5%A1%94%E5%85%A8%E6%99%AF_2023.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/df/%E8%8B%8F%E5%85%AC%E5%A1%94%E5%85%A8%E6%99%AF_2023.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"HaziiDozen","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​苏公塔全景 2023","width":320,"height":240}}